xt Slide\nEmergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line\nThe MedVet New Albany team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers on the Northeast side of Columbus and surrounding communities.\nAs part of MedVet’s nationwide network of leading veterinary hospitals, the team at MedVet New Albany offers advanced, comprehensive emergency pet care. Whether it’s a late-night emergency or a weekend mishap, you can count on us. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you and your family veterinarian every step of the way.\nMedVet New Albany Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nOur Hospital Leaders\nEllen Neal, DVM\nMedical Director\nPaula Miller\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nTanner Baustian\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMary Edge\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAmanda Graber\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMia Gulan\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJessica Hemmelgarn\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCrystal King\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nZoe I. Marinacci\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMolly Miller\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEllen Neal\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKyle Relyea\n, DVM\nJessica Solomon\n, DVM, MPH\nEmergency Medicine\nPet Stories\n“\nMedVet treated my cat urgently and with kindness, as if he were their own. Easy registration, frequent updates on his condition, and pics showing the overnight staff’s extra love impressed me. Would definitely recommend and return for future emergencies.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur 