      "description": "Emergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line The MedVet New Albany team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers on the Northeast side of Columbus and surrounding communities. As part of MedVet’s nationwide network of leading veterinary hospitals, the team at MedVet New Albany offers advanced, comprehensive emergency pet care. Whether it’s a late-night emergency or a weekend mishap, you can count on us. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you and your family veterinarian every step of the way.",
